{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26231","headline":"襄口阻风 · 殷尧藩","name":"襄口阻风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪浪排空接海门，孤舟三日阻龙津。\n曹瞒曾堕周郎计，王导难遮庚亮尘。\n鸥散白云沈远浦，花飞红雨送残春。\n篙师整缆候明发，仍谒荒祠问鬼神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}